{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Great! I started up a Quickstarter campaign, and I managed to reach my first donation milestone!": "",
  "If you look over there in the distance, you may notice that construction is already happening as we speak!": "",
  "Wow! So far, so good.": "",
  "I noticed your donation too, Yagami-san! Honestly, I cannot thank you enough...": "",
  "For a while, I thought that nothing would ever go right for me again. But you changed all that. You... touched my life.": "",
  "Not sure if I'd put it like that...": "",
  "Anyway, I do still need to keep on gathering funds. It is a 50-story building, after all.": "",
  "50 floors!? Goddamn!": "",
  "Slow and steady wins the race, I suppose. We're gathering donations little by little, so please contribute if you can!": "",
  "...Sure.": "",
  "(50 floors, though? What kind of estimate did he even make in the first place?)": "",
  "Hello there, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, how's everything?": "",
  "Actually, we managed to reach our second donation milestone! Would you look at that!": "",
  "Wow... It's starting to look like a real corporate office.": "",
  "It's all thanks to you and your excellent knowledge!": "",
  "No, it's thanks to the people that funded it.": "",
  "Haha, true enough!": "",
  "Oh, I know! Yagami-san, would you like to take a picture with that building in the background?": "",
  "Huh? What for?": "",
  "It's not every day you get to see a building built by crowdfunding. I think that's pretty neat.": "",
  "Do I really need to be in there?": "",
  "C'mon, just a single picture wouldn't hurt! Right?": "",
  "Well, if you insist...": "",
  "Hey, that turned out great! Feel free to share it with anyone and everyone.": "",
  "Well, all that's left to do now is keep moving forward! Rather, moving on up!": "",
  "Fifty floors is still a long way away, but I'm sure you'll make it eventually.": "",
  "I know I will. You've been such a big help, Yagami-san. Again, I can't thank you enough!": "",
  "Please come and visit us as soon as the building is done.": "",
  "Sure. I'll be looking forward to that.": "",
  "In the meantime, I'll be formulating better strategies to get the rest of the funds. I hope we meet again, Yagami-san!": "",
  "...In this life, of course!": "",
  "I'm sure we will.": "",
  "(Seems like he's doing a lot better than back when we first met. Good for him.)": "",
  "(Though I never would've guessed his fundraiser would take off so fast... Maybe I should start one for my rent!)": "",
  "(I think the drone went down this way...)": "",
  "Eh? Whoa, whoa, whoa!": "",
  "Ouch... What gives...?": "",
  "S-So sorry!": "",
  "*huff* *huff* A-Are you all right? Are you hurt?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm fine, I guess.": "",
  "O-Oh, what a relief.": "",
  "Hmm, but I guess my customization was all wrong. I need to put more of a focus on speed...": "",
  "(Now what's he babbling about?)": "",
  "I don't think speed is the point, man. You need to be careful when you're flying drones in a crowded city.": "",
  "O-Oh, yes, you're right! Sorry, this little guy goes pretty wild sometimes. Haha.": "",
  "It's not funny, if you ask me. I'd say you're just a bad pilot.": "",
  "Ugh, can't argue with you there...": "",
  "B-But flying drones is pretty hard, you know?": "",
  "I know, I have one myself.": "",
  "Oh, you do!? That makes us rivals, then!": "",
  "Excuse me? Rivals?": "",
  "Yeah, you're probably on your way to register now, aren't you?": "",
  "Uh, back it up. Register for what?": "",
  "Wha!? How do you not know? The drone races, man!": "",
  "...There's a race?": "",
  "Sure is. It's today!": "",
  "In fact, when my drone came at you, I was in the middle of a test flight!": "",
  "So I see. But is it even legal to fly that fast in the city?": "",
  "Of course it is for a race! You've gotta go fast to win!": "",
  "In fact, the sign up area is just ahead! Why don't you enter?": "",
  "Come on! Right over here! Get a move on!": "",
  "Hey...!": "",
  "This is where you sign up!": "",
  "Looks like you've got a pretty lively little community.": "",
  "Yeah, everyone's doing last minute mods for the race!": "",
  "Customs, huh?": "",
  "Yeah, tweaking it for maximum speed is the only way you're gonna win!": "",
  "Hey, I know! Show me your drone!": "",
  "Hm? Okay...": "",
  "Hmm, this could be a little rough, but...": "",
  "I need to borrow your drone!": "",
  "Fine, but, what are you planning on doing?": "",
  "Heh, don't worry. This'll make up for crashing into you earlier. Just this once.": "",
  "There, you're good to go!": "",
  "What did you do?": "",
  "I modified it so it'd be faster!": "",
  "You did? I don't see a difference.": "",
  "I only modded the guts. But when you see it in the race, your jaw's gonna hit the floor.": "",
  "Really...?": "",
  "Just make sure not to fly too fast outside the race, okay?": "",
  "They've been cracking down on us because of a few bad apples.": "",
  "(How does a guy who crash landed right into my face give me a speed lecture?)": "",
  "Hm? What's going on over there?": "",
  "Oh, that's the drone lab.": "",
  "...Lab?": "",
  "To put it simply, they make drone parts.": "",
  "If you're ever struggling with a race, you can hit them up to improve your machine.": "",
  "(Ah, so the goal is to customize it yourself...)": "",
  "All right, I think that does it for me. Next time we meet, it'll be on the race track!": "",
  "Oh, I never gave you my name, did I? It's Makihara.": "",
  "If you ever have any questions about drone racing, just let me know!": "",
  "(...Drone racing, huh? Well, it does sound fun.)": "",
  "Hey, who was she?": "",
  "Oh, one of my regulars. She was asking about a customer who was trying to hit on her.": "",
  "Hitting on her? What would she want with him?": "",
  "Apparently, the guy turned out to be a con artist. She said he tricked her into buying something really expensive.": "",
  "So she was trying to figure out if he came around here often, figure out where he works, all that.": "",
  "And I guess I should let her know if I ever see him again.": "",
  "All kinds of cons in this town... Which type was he?": "",
  "Apparently he's a real friendly, eloquent type who gets a woman comfy and then sells her on something worthless.": "",
  "There's even a reward for him. What's his name...": "",
  "Ah, I forgot. But I'll remember his face if I see it.": "",
  "Hm. I could keep an eye out for him too if I knew what he looked like.": "",
  "Want me to send you a photo if I ever get my hands on one?": "",
  "Yeah, that'd be great.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-kun! Good timing! It's terrible!": "",
  "What's wrong, Tomioka-san?": "",
  "I just called the police, but there's a man threatening to jump off the roof of the building!": "",
  "If he jumps and dies, heaven forbid, the building will bear that stigma for years! Can you try to stop him?": "",
  "I-I can try!": "",
  "Wh-Who are you!?": "",
  "Just a tenant here in the building, man. You know it would hurt us all if you died here, right?": "",
  "Then maybe you shouldn't have kept the roof unlocked!": "",
  "You know there's lots of taller buildings around here, right? Why did you have to pick this one?": "",
  "Y-Yagami-kun! This is no time for jokes!": "",
  "Um, right. I'm Yagami, a local detective. What's your name?": "",
  "It's Sunada. Kenji Sunada. I'm a police officer.": "",
  "You're a cop and you're considering suicide?": "",
  "What's so wrong with that!? Even cops get depressed, you know!": "",
  "That's true, that's true...": "",
  "Sunada-san... Why would you want to kill yourself, anyway?": "",
  "I've been betrayed! Aoi betrayed me!": "",
  "Aoi? That your girlfriend or something?": "",
  "Yes! She cheated on me with another man!": "",
  "If she dumps me, I couldn't go on living!": "",
  "(So this was all brought about by a relationship going sour...)": "",
  "Well, are you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>sure</font_kind> Aoi-san is cheating on you?": "",
  "I'm sure! I smelled another man's hair products all over her!": "",
  "You smelled hair products and immediately jumped to the conclusion that she's cheating?": "",
  "It was enough! She wouldn't answer me when I confronted her about it!": "",
  "Couldn't it be a misunderstanding, and she's upset that you accused her?": "",
  "Yeah, maybe she was on a crowded train...": "",
  "Y-You think so?": "",
  "Yeah, it happens all the time.": "",
  "Besides, if you died over a misunderstanding, you'd never find happiness in the next life.": "",
  "Th-Then...": "",
  "You have to prove it!": "",
  "Huh? I do?": "",
  "Yeah! You're a detective, right!? And based on what you find, I'll decide whether I die or not!": "",
  "(Is this guy for real right now...?)": "",
  "He's got a point, Yagami-san. An infidelity case should be a normal day at the office for you, right?": "",
  "Y-Yeah, but... I'm pretty busy right now...": "",
  "Then I'll just jump! I swear, I'll do it!": "",
  "Come on. At this rate, he'll eventually work up the courage.": "",
  "F-Fine.": "",
  "I'll do it, Sunada-san. Where can I find your Aoi?": "",
  "She works at Smile Burger on Nakamichi Street. She'll probably be there.": "",
  "What does she look like?": "",
  "...Okay, I get it. I'll get started, then.": "",
  "But don't even think about jumping until I get back!": "",
  "Fine! But I'm still going to jump if she's cheating on me!": "",
  "(Is Aoi-san here? She should have short hair and glasses.)": "",
  "(Is that her?)": "",
  "Hey, Aoi-chan. I'm back.": "",
  "Oh, Fujinaga-san?": "",
  "(Maybe that's a friend?)": "",
  "Yeah, I was just in the area. What time are you off?": "",
  "In a few minutes, actually.": "",
  "Ah, beautiful. Keep smiling, then.": "",
  "(Her shift ends in a few minutes, huh? I can wait it out.)": "",
  "Hey, Aoi-chan!": "",
  "I thought maybe you'd have some time after you got off. Wanna grab a drink?": "",
  "I saw a cute café I wanted to try, but no self-respecting man would buy sweets without a beautiful lady to taste them.": "",
  "I won't take much of your time, honest!": "",
  "Okay, fine. I could go for some sweets right about now, anyway.": "",
  "(Is she heading off with that guy? They look pretty close...)": "",
  "(This isn't going so well... I better follow them to make sure, though.)": "",
  "Your boyfriend works odd hours, huh? You must be so lonely.": "",
  "Yeah, sometimes...": "",
  "So why waste your time on a man who can't give you the time of day?": "",
  "You know, if I was your boyfriend, I would <font_kind=yakuza_italic>always</font_kind> make time for you, Aoi-chan.": "",
  "That, I promise you.": "",
  "What are you getting at...?": "",
  "Aoi-chan, I like you.": "",
  "F-Fujinaga-san?": "",
  "I'm serious, Aoi-chan. Do you feel the same way, though?": "",
  "I do... like you a lot, Fujinaga-san...": "",
  "Crap! She's totally guilty!": "",
  "Hope you know you signed a death warrant today, Aoi-san. But I better get a picture as proof...": "",
  "(Well, time to go report the results. This is going to suck...)": "",
  "Yagami-kun! What's the verdict?": "",
  "Aoi was really cheating on me, wasn't she!?": "",
  "O-Oh, well...": "",
  "This isn't easy for me to say, but...": "",
  "Well... Uh... I couldn't find any concrete evidence.": "",
  "Maybe you should put this whole suicide thing on hold, Sunada-san. I can keep working on it tomorrow.": "",
  "I can't wait another day! Today is the anniversary of the day I met Aoi!": "",
  "It's too poetic to pass up!": "",
  "If you can't bring me a conclusive result, I'm not budging!": "",
  "(Guess I've got no choice...)": "",
  "Actually, I lied. I did manage to get some proof...": "",
  "Wh-What?": "",
  "In conclusion... Yes, Aoi-san is guilty.": "",
  "What!? Then...": "",
  "It's true. She's cheating on you.": "",
  "A-Aoi... I can't believe it...": "",
  "That's it! I'm going to kill myself! This is where I die!": "",
  "Sunada-san, let's not do anything drastic!": "",
  "He's right! There are so many other fish in the sea! But you need to be alive to catch them!": "",
  "I don't want to catch them! If Aoi is going to dump me, I'd rather be dead!": "",
  "W-Wait! Don't do this!": "",
  "Damn, who's calling me right now of all times!? The bartender?": "",
  "(I shouldn't be taking calls right now... I've got to stop him from doing this!)": "",
  "This is it! The final moments! Are you ready, cruel world!?": "",
  "No, stop! What about us! We're not ready at all!": "",
  "He's right! There's so much more to live for... Isn't there!?": "",
  "Shut up! Without Aoi, I have nothing to live for! Nothing!": "",
  "(Damn, I'm out of ideas!)": "",
  "Why is he trying to reach me so bad...": "",
  "(Wait, he's a bartender! He probably has all kinds of ways to talk people out of suicide!)": "",
  "Hey, great timing!": "",
  "You finally picked up! I have some good news, Tak.": "",
  "Good news? I'm not sure now's a good time, though...": "",
  "No, it's about that con artist I was telling you about. I saw him in town!": "",
  "Wait, the con artist?": "",
  "I lost sight of him pretty quickly, but not before I snapped his picture!": "",
  "I'll send it to you.": "",
  "Yeah, that's great, but hey, you have any tips for talking someone out of committing suicide!? It's important!": "",
  "Hahaha, you're kidding right? This isn't a TV show, man. If someone wants to die, they're gonna do it.": "",
  "Hey! Why are you taking phone calls when I'm about to die!? Is it a girl!? Are you calling your girlfriend!?": "",
  "How could you do this to me!?": "",
  "(We're totally out of options!)": "",
  "All right, for real this time! One... Two...": "",
  "W-Wait a minute! There's something else!": "",
  "Why won't you just let me die!?": "",
  "No, look at this guy!": "",
  "Who's that?": "",
  "Hey, why would you show me the face of the man Aoi is cheating on with right before I die!? That's just cruel!": "",
  "You're a cop, right!? Haven't you heard the name Junichi Fujinaga before? He's a wanted con artist!": "",
  "Yeah, I think so. He targets vulnerable women, right?": "",
  "Yeah, and get this... The man in this photo, that's him. Junichi Fujinaga.": "",
  "Wh-What...": "",
  "What did you say!?": "",
  "What's all this about a con artist now!?": "",
  "He's this bastard who befriends women and tries to sell them expensive pieces of junk.": "",
  "S-So you're saying...": "",
  "Yeah! Sunada-san, you can't die now! Your beautiful Aoi-chan is being conned!": "",
  "Y-You're right! I've gotta go save her! Where is she, Yagami-san!?": "",
  "On the rooftop of Kamuro Theater!": "",
  "Ahhhhhh! Aoi, I'm coming, sweeheart!": "",
  "Wait for me, Aoi!": "",
  "Guess he won't be dying today...": "",
  "Amazing. That must be the power of love...": "",
  "I'm sorry, Kenji! I had you all this time, but...": "",
  "It's okay. I know I've been so busy lately... You must have felt so ignored!": "",
  "I'm so sorry.": "",
  "Why are you so kind to me, Kenji?": "",
  "Why? Because without you, I'd...": "",
  "I couldn't go on living.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
